The zz9000 AMIX kernel driver (/dev/zz9000, major 49) as kits for the AMIX
Installer: object files and relink scripts the installer links into your
own kernel, the stock AMIX 2.1c kernel (zz9000) or the 68040/060 port kernel
(zz9000-040), for an MNT ZZ9000 (16-bit RTG).  No AMIX kernel is included.
